# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# opt-fastboot: trade image size for time-to-userspace.
#
# LZ4 decompresses roughly 3x faster than zstd at ~10-15% larger image.  On a
# machine that boots once a month that is a bad trade; on a microVM that is
# created per request, decompression is a visible fraction of total boot.
#
# Pair with a `quiet` command line: every printk to a 115200 serial console is
# ~1ms of boot spent talking to nobody.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CONFIG_KERNEL_ZSTD is not set
CONFIG_KERNEL_LZ4=y
# (An uncompressed embedded initramfs would skip a second decompression pass,
# but INITRAMFS_COMPRESSION_* only exists when INITRAMFS_SOURCE is set at
# build time.  We ship an external initramfs, so that is a bootloader-side
# decision, not a config one.)
